<h1>Message</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Displays user text in pedal or standard Windows dialog.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Text</b></i></span> – string that have to be displayed in the message:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Type</b></i></span> – determines the type of the dialog that should display the text. Available values are 0 (for pedal dialog) and 1 (for standard Windows message box).</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">UI Commands: <span style="font-weight:normal;">None</span>.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Message( Type="Hello world!", Type=0 )</p>
